# Frontend (Next.js)

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router + React 19, **JSX**
- Tailwind CSS v4: `@import "tailwindcss"` in `src/app/globals.css`
- **Cloudflare Workers** via OpenNext — SSR, not static export
- Sanity CMS via `@sanity/client` (`src/lib/sanity/`)

## Data layer

- **Primary:** Sanity API fetched server-side (`getProducts()`, `getProductBySlugFromStore()`)
- **Fallback:** `src/mockData.js` when Sanity is empty or unreachable
- Static config: `src/data/*.js` (categories, brand, policies)
- Helpers: `src/lib/*.js` — pass `products` array to catalog/type helpers

Use React `cache()` via `productStore.js` — one Sanity fetch per request.

## Components

- Server Components by default; `'use client'` for interactivity
- `ProductDataProvider` in `PageLayout` supplies products to client nav/components
- Client catalog/search components accept `products` prop or use `useProducts()`

## SEO & metadata

Every page needs `metadata` or `generateMetadata`. Content pages use `export const revalidate = 60`.

## Performance

- Prefer `next/image`; Sanity CDN images allowed in `next.config.js`
- Avoid unnecessary client JS and new npm packages

## Inquiry form

Client-side only — Zalo/Messenger, `mailto`, or Formspree.
